          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pack-item">
        <span>✓</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Simple Weeknight Serving Ideas</h3>
          <p>
            Turn a jar into tacos, bowls, sandwiches, stews, or comforting
            dinners without starting from scratch.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="note">
      From jar to table in 25 minutes or less — no experience needed.
