  </section>

  <section class="problem-section">
    <div class="problem-card">
      <h2>Because canned meat should never feel boring</h2>

      <p>
        Plain jars are practical — but the right sauce makes them feel like a
        real meal.
      </p>

      <ul class="simple-list">
        <li>Add flavor without extra planning.</li>
        <li>Use the broth straight from the jar.</li>
        <li>Make one batch work in multiple ways.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        This guide gives you simple finishing sauces that make your pantry feel
        more flexible, flavorful, and useful.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>How You’ll Use It</h2>

    <div class="steps">
      <div>
        <span>1</span>
        <h3>Open a Jar</h3>
        <p>Choose one of your canned meat recipes.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <span>2</span>
        <h3>Pick a Sauce</h3>
        <p>Use the pairing guide to choose the best match.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <span>3</span>
        <h3>Serve Fast</h3>
        <p>Finish the meal in 25 minutes or less.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final-cta" id="signup">
    <h2>Make the Most of Every Jar</h2>

    <p>
      Download the free sauce guide and turn simple pantry jars into fast,
      flavorful meals.
    </p>

    <button class="openModal button" style="margin-top: 12px;">
      Download the Free Sauce Guide
    </button>

    <p class="privacy">
      No spam. Just practical recipes you’ll actually use.
    </p>
  </section>
</main>

<div
  id="modal"
  class="fixed inset-0 hidden items-center justify-center bg-black bg-opacity-40 backdrop-blur-sm z-50"
>
  <div class="m-2 bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl max-w-md w-full">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
      <h2 style="padding-top: 40px">Get Your Free Sauce Guide</h2>
      <button
          id="closeModal"
          class="text-gray-500 hover:text-black"
        >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          class="w-5 h-5"
          fill="none"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          stroke="currentColor"
        >
          <path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"
          />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="_form_1"></div>
    <script
      src="https://gahema.activehosted.com/f/embed.php?id=1"
      charset="utf-8"
    ></script>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  const modal = document.getElementById("modal");
  const openBtns = document.querySelectorAll(".openModal");
  const closeBtn = document.getElementById("closeModal");

  function openModal() {
    modal.classList.remove("hidden");
    modal.classList.add("flex");
  }

  function closeModal() {
    modal.classList.add("hidden");
    modal.classList.remove("flex");
  }

  openBtns.forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener("click", openModal);
  });

  closeBtn.addEventListener("click", closeModal);

  modal.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
    if (e.target === modal) closeModal();
  });

  document.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
    if (e.key === "Escape") closeModal();
  });
</script>